msgstr "Anvendt og aktiv"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:33
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:474
msgid "Applied and verified"
msgstr "Anvendt og verificeret"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:520
msgid "Applied by falcond while Turbo is on, and undone when it is turned off. Saved through the privileged helper."
msgstr "Anvendes af falcond, mens Turbo er slået til, og fortrydes, når det slås fra. Gemmes via den privilegerede hjælper."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:1500
msgid "Applied by falcond while this game runs, whichever launcher starts it. Saved through the privileged helper when you save."
msgstr "Anvendes af falcond, mens dette spil kører, uanset hvilken launcher der starter det. Gemmes via den privilegerede hjælper, når du gemmer."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:46
msgid "Applied while each game runs by the component that owns it, and restored when the game exits."
msgstr "Anvendes, mens hvert spil kører, af den komponent, der ejer det, og gendannes, når spillet afslutter."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:898
msgid "Applied, but the game shows a problem — Diagnose says why"
msgstr "Anvendt, men spillet viser et problem — Diagnosticer fortæller hvorfor"

