msgstr "Hovedkontakten: falcond optimerer hvert spil, når det starter"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:159
msgid "The measurement stopped without an answer. Open Logs to see why."
msgstr "Målingen stoppede uden svar. Åbn Logfiler for at se hvorfor."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:167
msgid "The mode is handed to scx_loader when falcond starts a sched-ext scheduler. Each scheduler turns it into its own options; a scheduler without a setting for a mode runs as in Default. With no scheduler chosen, the mode does nothing."
msgstr "Tilstanden gives videre til scx_loader, når falcond starter en sched-ext-scheduler. Hver scheduler omsætter den til sine egne indstillinger; en scheduler uden en indstilling for en tilstand kører som i Standard. Uden valgt scheduler gør tilstanden intet."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:247
msgid "The mode the profile asked for is not the one set."
msgstr "Den tilstand, profilen bad om, er ikke den, der er sat."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/launch.rs:215
msgid "The most frames; the image is visibly softer."
msgstr "Flest billeder; billedet er synligt blødere."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1705
msgid "The newest stable release on OptiScaler's GitHub page, never older than the tested one. Taken only with a single archive and a published SHA-256, which the download is checked against."
msgstr "Den nyeste stabile udgivelse på OptiScalers GitHub-side, aldrig ældre end den testede. Tages kun med ét enkelt arkiv og en offentliggjort SHA-256, som overførslen kontrolleres mod."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1074
msgid "The next game gets its profile as it starts."
msgstr "Det næste spil får sin profil, når det starter."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/app.rs:474
